{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Two: Solar Home",
    "steam_appid": 3552440,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552440/extras/7815667b4f5b10384515050060d4cf28.poster.avif?t=1743123033\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552440/extras/7815667b4f5b10384515050060d4cf28.apng?t=1743123033\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=71 /></picture></span><strong>\u300aTwo: Solar Home\u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0is a local co-op platformer game for <i>two players</i>, featuring impressive <i>pixel art</i> and handcrafted levels. Players take on the roles of a brother and sister exploring the collapsed solar system and the silent, deserted space of their once-thriving home to uncover past secrets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a cooperative journey, finding joy in overcoming challenges together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your spaceship as a mobile home, collecting items and achievements along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a heartwarming and captivating storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the elusive, flying hearts you strive to capture.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game controls are relatively simple and finely tuned, using just a few basic buttons to maneuver the characters. Level elements enhance the experience, offering a unique sense of excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can clearly see the path through each level, but good coordination and occasional observation of each other\u2019s actions are essential for success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and enjoy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy it, especially if you're a fan of platformer\u2014this is a must-try!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552440/extras/7815667b4f5b10384515050060d4cf28.poster.avif?t=1743123033\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552440/extras/7815667b4f5b10384515050060d4cf28.apng?t=1743123033\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=71 /></picture></span><strong>\u300aTwo: Solar Home\u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0is a local co-op platformer game for <i>two players</i>, featuring impressive <i>pixel art</i> and handcrafted levels. Players take on the roles of a brother and sister exploring the collapsed solar system and the silent, deserted space of their once-thriving home to uncover past secrets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a cooperative journey, finding joy in overcoming challenges together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your spaceship as a mobile home, collecting items and achievements along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a heartwarming and captivating storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the elusive, flying hearts you strive to capture.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game controls are relatively simple and finely tuned, using just a few basic buttons to maneuver the characters. Level elements enhance the experience, offering a unique sense of excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can clearly see the path through each level, but good coordination and occasional observation of each other\u2019s actions are essential for success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and enjoy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy it, especially if you're a fan of platformer\u2014this is a must-try!</p>",
